@guide H_Feralas
@name Feralas (Camp Mojache)
@faction Horde
@levels 43-47
@zone Feralas
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Camp Mojache, the Northspring harpies, the Twin Colossals giants and the Grimtotem compound.
@next H_Hinterlands

fp Camp Mojache
bind Camp Mojache
level 45 | Camp Mojache's quests need level 45. If you are short, kill gnolls and yetis around the camp until you ding.
accept Dark Heart | Talo Thornhoof, Camp Mojache.
accept Vengeance on the Northspring
accept Zapped Giants | Zorbin Fandazzle on the coast.
accept Fuel for the Zapping
complete Vengeance on the Northspring | Northspring harpies.
complete Dark Heart | Harpy chieftain at the Northspring nest.
turnin Vengeance on the Northspring
turnin Dark Heart
complete Zapped Giants | Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker on Wave Striders and Land Walkers.
complete Fuel for the Zapping | Water elementals on the coast.
turnin Zapped Giants
turnin Fuel for the Zapping
level 46
train
note Fly to Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands (via the Undercity or Tarren Mill).
